          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nwang’u amaci, m’ukadhu piny ma dhanu mir ali giyaku, en e rombe rubanga dak abusiel ku pier abiro wi abic, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man koni dhiang’ rubanga pier abiro wi ario, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man kana rubanga pier abusiel wi acel, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man dhanu kagi ceke gi rubanga pier adek wi ario, jumamon ma ging’eyo co ngo ku vuto kude. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ng’ete, ma en e makapiny mi ju m’ucidho woko ba lwiny, welne rombe rubanga dak adek ku pier adek wi abiro ku dak abic: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man ajok pa Yehova mi rombe en e dak abusiel ku pier abiro wi abic. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man koni dhiang’ gi rubanga pier adek wi abusiel; i kind maeni ajok pa Yehova en e pier abiro wi ario. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E kana gi rubanga pier adek ku dak abic; i kind maeno ajok pa Yehova en e pier abusiel wi acel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man dhanu gi rubanga apar wi acel; i kind maeni ajok pa Yehova en e dhanu pier adek wi ario. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Musa mio ajokne, ma en e lam m’ating’a pa Yehova, ni Eleazar ma jalam, calu Yehova ng’olo ni Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
