          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man jego ma ni wi rubanga mir udul, jego mi rubanga, man jego mi dak, gibino ceng’ni ba Musa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man giwacu ni Musa kumae, Jutic peri gikwanu wel mi dhanu mir ali ma gini the cingwa, c ng’atu acel de mbe m’urem i kindwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man wakelo girathiera pa Yehova, gin ma dhanu ceke kubang’gi kubang’gi ginwang’u, mi ruko mi mola ma kwar, ku nyoro mi ng’udi tielo, man gwang’, ku Jagith mir ayi, ku gwilo mi ith, man alotnbe mi bot, kara utim adunya pi ng’eyong’ec mwa i wang’ Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Musa giku Eleazar ma jalam gigamu inula ma kwar i bang’gi, en e jambruko ceke m’atima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man mola ma kwar ceke mi lam m’ating’a ma githiero ni Yehova, mi jego mi rubanga, man mi jego mi dak, en e cekel rubanga apar wi abusiel ku dak abiro ku pier abic. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Kum dhanu mir ali giyaku piny, ku ba dhanu ku ba dhanu ire gire.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Musa giku Eleazar ma jalam gigamu mola ma kwar i cing’ jego mi rubanga man mi dak, man gikele i hema mi cokri, ni poi mi nyithindho mir Israel i wang’ Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.54"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
